---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Adult Content Blocker - Fish Sauce Games">
  <section class="project-hero">
    <div class="project-text">
      <h1>Adult Content Blocker</h1>
      <p>A lightweight Android app that blocks adult content on your device. Install it directly from the .apk below — no Play Store required.</p>
      <a href="/downloads/AdultContentBlocker.apk" class="btn-primary" download>Download APK</a>
    </div>
    <div class="project-media">
      <img src="/images/AdultContentBlocker.png" alt="Adult Content Blocker app" onerror="this.style.display='none'" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="install-instructions">
    <h2>How to install</h2>
    <p class="intro">Follow these steps in order on your Android phone. It takes about five minutes.</p>

    <h3>1. Install the app</h3>
    <ol>
      <li>Tap <strong>Download APK</strong> above. The file (<code>AdultContentBlocker.apk</code>) will land in your <strong>Downloads</strong> folder.</li>
      <li>Open your <strong>Files</strong> app, go to <strong>Downloads</strong>, and tap <strong>AdultContentBlocker.apk</strong>.</li>
      <li>Tap <strong>Install</strong> on the "Install this app?" prompt.</li>
      <li>Google Play Protect will scan the file and say <strong>"This app looks safe"</strong> — tap <strong>Install</strong> again to confirm.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="note">Since this app isn't on the Play Store, Android shows extra warnings during this process. That's expected — Play Protect scans every .apk you install, and once it says the app looks safe you're good to continue.</p>

    <h3>2. Open the app and grant permissions</h3>
    <ol>
      <li>Open the app from your home screen (look for the shield icon).</li>
      <li>When asked to allow notifications, tap <strong>Allow</strong> — this lets the app alert you when it blocks something.</li>
      <li>You'll land on a <strong>Setup</strong> screen with a few items to turn on, each with an <strong>Open settings</strong> button:</li>
    </ol>

    <h4>Accessibility service</h4>
    <ol>
      <li>Tap <strong>Open settings</strong> next to "Accessibility service."</li>
      <li>Tap <strong>AntiAdultContent monitoring</strong> in the list.</li>
      <li>Turn on <strong>Use AntiAdultContent monitoring</strong>.</li>
      <li>Tap <strong>Allow</strong> on the "Allow full control of your device?" prompt. This is required so the app can detect which app or website is open and block adult content.</li>
    </ol>

    <h4>Display over other apps</h4>
    <ol>
      <li>Back on the Setup screen, tap <strong>Open settings</strong> next to "Display over other apps."</li>
      <li>Turn on <strong>Allow display over other apps</strong>. This lets the app show a full-screen block page when it catches something, instead of just a plain screen.</li>
    </ol>

    <h4>Ignore battery optimization</h4>
    <ol>
      <li>Tap <strong>Open settings</strong> next to "Ignore battery optimization" and tap <strong>Allow</strong>. This stops Android from shutting the app down in the background, so protection stays active.</li>
    </ol>

    <h3>3. Set up Private DNS (recommended)</h3>
    <p>This is the most important step — it blocks adult content network-wide, at the DNS level, in a way apps can't bypass by redirecting around the app's own filtering.</p>
    <ol>
      <li>On the Setup screen, find <strong>Private DNS filtering</strong> and tap <strong>Set it up</strong> (or go to <strong>Settings → Network &amp; Internet → Private DNS</strong> yourself).</li>
      <li>Select <strong>Private DNS provider hostname</strong>.</li>
      <li>Enter the hostname: <code>family-filter-dns.cleanbrowsing.org</code></li>
      <li>Tap <strong>Save</strong>.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="note">You'll know it worked when Network and Internet → Private DNS shows "family-filter-dns.cleanbrowsing.org" underneath it.</p>

    <h3>4. Choose what to protect</h3>
    <p>Back in the app, under <strong>Protection</strong>:</p>
    <ol>
      <li>Tap <strong>Choose blocked apps</strong> to select any apps you want blocked outright.</li>
      <li>Tap <strong>Choose monitored browsers</strong> to select which browsers the app should watch for adult sites.</li>
      <li><strong>Force SafeSearch</strong> is on by default — it adds SafeSearch to Google, Bing, DuckDuckGo, and Brave in the browsers you monitor.</li>
    </ol>

    <p class="note">Once everything above shows a checkmark on the Setup screen, protection is active. Blocked attempts will show up under "Recent blocks" in the app.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .project-hero {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 90px);
    padding: 3rem 4rem;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .project-text {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    max-width: 420px;
  }

  .project-text h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .project-text p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #c0c8d8;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .project-media {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 300px;
    background-color: #000000;
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .project-media img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    max-height: 520px;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .install-instructions {
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    max-width: 860px;
  }

  .install-instructions h2 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .install-instructions .intro {
    color: #c0c8d8;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .install-instructions h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .install-instructions h4 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #c0c8d8;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .install-instructions p {
    color: #c0c8d8;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .install-instructions ol {
    color: #c0c8d8;
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .install-instructions li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .install-instructions code {
    background-color: #1a2130;
    color: #e8ecf4;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }

  .note {
    color: #6b7a99;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .project-hero {
      flex-direction: column;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .project-text {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
